<h1>Privacy and Application Data</h1>

<p>CEMS stores account information, Event details, and current participant registrations for the course application's
    workflows.</p>
    <p>Signed-in participants can review their own current registrations. An Organizer can view participant names and email
addresses for owned Events. An Organizer who also has the Administrator role may view registrations for Events owned
by other Organizers. An Administrator-only account cannot access that registration-detail endpoint.</p>
<p>Administrative role management and Event oversight are separate operations. This description documents the classroom    application's current access behavior; it is not an institutional retention or legal privacy policy.</p>